{
 "about": "AutoFill (docs/adr/0050-keychain-autofill-and-passkeys.mdx, decision 6) in Bloom's fields (sample/LoginFormProbe.tsx), which say only what they hold (`textContentType`, `autoComplete`), with the development compositor's fixture keychain (`autofill`: made-up logins of the application, a strong password, a code) and the session's shell drawing the list, the screen reader on in Spanish. Focusing the username field asks for the application's suggestions and shows them under the caret, a key and the username over the site, the first on the accent and said; ↓ and ↑ move it, each said, and the field hears none of those keys; Escape hides it. Focusing the password field, paired with the username, shows them again; a press on a login fills its password into the field and its username into the username field, as typed: React hears each change, the password only as bullets, and it never appears in a report. The new password field is offered Use Strong Password with the password shown, Return filling it; the code field the logins whose code it takes, Return filling the current code. At 1.25 (1600 × 1000), dark, the accent jade.",
 "locale": "es_ES.UTF-8",
 "module": "LoginFormProbe",
 "window": [
  800,
  480
 ],
 "app": {
  "id": "so.oxy.loginprobe",
  "title": "Login probe"
 },
 "autofill": {
  "application": "so.oxy.loginprobe"
 },
 "shell": "OxyOSShell",
 "reader": {},
 "steps": [
  {
   "name": "the form with the shell, the screen reader on: no list",
   "do": [
    "wait",
    1500
   ],
   "allow_unchanged": true,
   "expect": {
    "autofill": {
     "shown": null,
     "asked": []
    },
    "shell": {
     "candidates": null
    },
    "never": [
     "fixture-Passw0rd"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "the username field focused: the application's logins under its caret, the first highlighted and said",
   "do": [
    "press",
    [
     400,
     42
    ]
   ],
   "expect": {
    "focus_input": "username",
    "autofill": {
     "shown": {
      "highlighted": 0,
      "items": [
       {
        "kind": "Login",
        "title": "example.com",
        "detail": "bea@example.com"
       },
       {
        "kind": "Login",
        "title": "example.com",
        "detail": "ana@example.com"
       }
      ]
     },
     "asked": [
      "suggest username"
     ]
    },
    "shell": {
     "candidates": [
      276,
      197,
      252,
      100
     ]
    },
    "announcements": [
     {
      "politeness": "polite",
      "text": "bea@example.com, example.com, 1 de 2",
      "live": true
     }
    ],
    "transactions": [],
    "never": [
     "fixture-Passw0rd"
    ],
    "react": {
     "touchStart@username": 1,
     "touchEnd@username": 1,
     "focus@username": 1,
     "selectionChange@username": 1
    },
    "at": {
     "shell": [
      {
       "role": "List",
       "name": "bea@example.com, example.com, 1 de 2",
       "state": [
        "live-polite"
       ]
      },
      {
       "role": "ListItem",
       "name": "bea@example.com, example.com, 1 de 2",
       "position": [
        1,
        2
       ],
       "state": [
        "selected"
       ]
      },
      {
       "role": "ListItem",
       "name": "ana@example.com, example.com, 2 de 2",
       "position": [
        2,
        2
       ],
       "state": []
      }
     ]
    }
   }
  },
